<title>PHILIPPINES: TENNIS-INDONESIA BEATS PHILIPPINES 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-INDONESIA BEATS PHILIPPINES 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia beat the Philippines 3-2 in their Davis Cup tennis Asia/Oceania zone group I, first round tie after winning both reverse singles on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results (Indonesian names first): Suwandi Suwandi beat Joseph Lizardo 6-2 1-6 6-3 5-7 6-2 Bonit Wiryawan beat Robert Angelo 6-3 1-6 4-6 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Indonesia meet New Zealand in the second round from April 4-6.</p>
</text>
